## 7. Stack Summary

| Component           | Technology              | Purpose                                           |
|---------------------|-------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|
| Escrow Contract     | Solidity (Base Sepolia) | Holds USDC and Resource Claim NFTs                |
| Solver Agent        | Python (Wake)           | Ingests Context Payload, generates patches        |
| Inference Proxy     | Node/Express            | Wraps Anthropic; bills against Staked Credits     |
| CI Oracle           | Node.js                 | Listens to GitHub Webhooks to trigger payouts     |
| Sleeve CLI          | Rust                    | Orchestrates local env and proxies Compute Credits|
| Headless Onboarding | Dynamic Node SDK        | Mints Agent Identities for bystanders             |
| Bounty Feed         | Web/Mobile App          | Marketplace UI for active Context Payloads        |
| SimBountyNet        | TBD                     | Simulated Stakers/Solvers for demo activity       |

